 "/templates/location-scout-template": "<div style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:14vh 24px 24px;\"><article><h1 style=\"font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:650;margin:0 0 .4em;\">Location scout template</h1><p style=\"color:#d0d0d4;font-size:1.1rem;margin:0 0 1.2em;\">A recce grid: one row per location, three frames across — the wide that shows the space, the detail that shows the problem, and a photo of the light at the hour you would actually shoot. Three locations compared on one page instead of three folders.</p><p style=\"color:#8a8a92;font-size:.85rem;\">Contact sheet · 3 × 3 — 9 boxes. · <time datetime=\"2026-08-27\">Updated August 27, 2026</time></p><section><h2 style=\"font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:600;margin:1.4em 0 .4em;\">What each box is for</h2><ol><li>LOCATION A — WIDE</li><li>A — DETAIL</li><li>A — LIGHT</li><li>LOCATION B — WIDE</li><li>B — DETAIL</li><li>B — LIGHT</li><li>LOCATION C — WIDE</li><li>C — DETAIL</li><li>C — LIGHT</li></ol><p>Each label shows only while its box is empty, and is never written into the box.</p></section><nav aria-label=\"Related pages\" style=\"margin-top:1.6em;\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;\">More templates</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/templates\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">All grid templates</a></li><li><a href=\"/templates/shot-list-template\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/templates/shot-list-template</a></li><li><a href=\"/templates/casting-board-template\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/templates/casting-board-template</a></li><li><a href=\"/tools/shot-list-maker\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/tools/shot-list-maker</a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/canvas/grids\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">Grids documentation</a></li></ul></nav><p style=\"color:#8a8a92;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:2em;\">Machine-readable: <a href=\"/templates/location-scout-template.md\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/templates/location-scout-template.md</a> · <a href=\"/llms.txt\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/llms.txt</a></p></article></div>",
