 "/templates/wedding-mood-board-template": "<div style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:14vh 24px 24px;\"><article><h1 style=\"font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:650;margin:0 0 .4em;\">Wedding mood board template</h1><p style=\"color:#d0d0d4;font-size:1.1rem;margin:0 0 1.2em;\">A wedding mood board arranged the way the decisions actually get made: the overall feeling across the top, then the three that everything else follows from — the dress, the flowers and the table setting. Share the link with your planner or your florist.</p><p style=\"color:#8a8a92;font-size:.85rem;\">Hero + 3 below — 4 boxes. · <time datetime=\"2026-08-27\">Updated August 27, 2026</time></p><section><h2 style=\"font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:600;margin:1.4em 0 .4em;\">What each box is for</h2><ol><li>THE FEELING</li><li>THE DRESS</li><li>FLOWERS</li><li>THE TABLE</li></ol><p>Each label shows only while its box is empty, and is never written into the box.</p></section><nav aria-label=\"Related pages\" style=\"margin-top:1.6em;\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;\">More templates</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/templates\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">All grid templates</a></li><li><a href=\"/templates/mood-board-template\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/templates/mood-board-template</a></li><li><a href=\"/templates/look-book-template\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/templates/look-book-template</a></li><li><a href=\"/tools/mood-board-maker\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/tools/mood-board-maker</a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/canvas/grids\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">Grids documentation</a></li></ul></nav><p style=\"color:#8a8a92;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:2em;\">Machine-readable: <a href=\"/templates/wedding-mood-board-template.md\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/templates/wedding-mood-board-template.md</a> · <a href=\"/llms.txt\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/llms.txt</a></p></article></div>",
