 "/templates/recipe-card-template": "<div style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:14vh 24px 24px;\"><article><h1 style=\"font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:650;margin:0 0 .4em;\">Recipe card template</h1><p style=\"color:#d0d0d4;font-size:1.1rem;margin:0 0 1.2em;\">The photo takes half the card because that is what someone decides on, and the ingredients, the method and the notes stack beside it in the order you use them. One card per recipe, and stamping a copy gives you the next one already laid out.</p><p style=\"color:#8a8a92;font-size:.85rem;\">Database row · 1 left / 3 stacked — 4 boxes. · <time datetime=\"2026-08-27\">Updated August 27, 2026</time></p><section><h2 style=\"font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:600;margin:1.4em 0 .4em;\">What each box is for</h2><ol><li>INGREDIENTS</li><li>THE DISH</li><li>METHOD</li><li>NOTES</li></ol><p>Each label shows only while its box is empty, and is never written into the box.</p></section><nav aria-label=\"Related pages\" style=\"margin-top:1.6em;\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;\">More templates</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/templates\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">All grid templates</a></li><li><a href=\"/templates/shot-list-template\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/templates/shot-list-template</a></li><li><a href=\"/templates/product-lineup-template\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/templates/product-lineup-template</a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/canvas/grids\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/docs/canvas/grids</a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/canvas/grids\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">Grids documentation</a></li></ul></nav><p style=\"color:#8a8a92;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:2em;\">Machine-readable: <a href=\"/templates/recipe-card-template.md\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/templates/recipe-card-template.md</a> · <a href=\"/llms.txt\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/llms.txt</a></p></article></div>",
 "/templates/social-media-grid-template": "<div style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:14vh 24px 24px;\"><article><h1 style=\"font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:650;margin:0 0 .4em;\">Social media grid template</h1><p style=\"color:#d0d0d4;font-size:1.1rem;margin:0 0 1.2em;\">A profile grid is three across, so planning one in any other shape means guessing. Nine numbered boxes in the same arrangement the feed uses, filled in posting order, showing how the next three rows will look together before you publish any of them.</p><p style=\"color:#8a8a92;font-size:.85rem;\">Contact sheet · 3 × 3 — 9 boxes. · <time datetime=\"2026-08-27\">Updated August 27, 2026</time></p><section><h2 style=\"font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:600;margin:1.4em 0 .4em;\">What each box is for</h2><ol><li>POST 1</li><li>POST 2</li><li>POST 3</li><li>POST 4</li><li>POST 5</li><li>POST 6</li><li>POST 7</li><li>POST 8</li><li>POST 9</li></ol><p>Each label shows only while its box is empty, and is never written into the box.</p></section><nav aria-label=\"Related pages\" style=\"margin-top:1.6em;\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;\">More templates</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/templates\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">All grid templates</a></li><li><a href=\"/templates/video-storyboard-template\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/templates/video-storyboard-template</a></li><li><a href=\"/templates/mood-board-template\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/templates/mood-board-template</a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/canvas/grids\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/docs/canvas/grids</a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/canvas/grids\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">Grids documentation</a></li></ul></nav><p style=\"color:#8a8a92;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:2em;\">Machine-readable: <a href=\"/templates/social-media-grid-template.md\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/templates/social-media-grid-template.md</a> · <a href=\"/llms.txt\" style=\"color:#FFA500;\">/llms.txt</a></p></article></div>"
